// `StaticSpec.AsEvent` under Lean's own name for it: an Off-Stack Static, "as
// [event], do". As `event` happens, `does` is carried out without using the
// stack, as a static ability is [CR#113.9]. A static ability of a resolving
// permanent spell that creates a delayed trigger creates it as the permanent is
// put onto the battlefield, with the spell as its source and the spell's
// controller as it resolved as its controller (dash, blitz, warp
// [CR#608.3g,603.7d]). "As this enters, …" text is written here too, where
// Lean writes it as a replacement of the entering (`replace … (also …)`,
// [CR#614.1c]).
(
    name: "asEvent",
    kinds: [StaticSpec],
    params: {"event": GameEvent, "does": Instruction},
    body: AsEvent(event: Param(event), does: Param(does)),
)
